      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Web app",
      "items": [
        "One Time store (site + UTC hour) fetches site data",
        "Views subscribe read-only; they never compute ephemerides",
        "MVP: calendar, polar map, site card; luxury: globes",
        "Built: the 3D globe (lazy-loaded) and the phone sheet, sharing a site store; the sheet reads one site's month from the API"
